{"seq":1,"slug":"ipc-overview","title":"IPC 概览与分类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/inter-process-communication/foundations/ipc-overview","wordCount":1604,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"ipc-概览与分类\">IPC 概览与分类</h1><p>把一个大程序拆成多个进程，几乎立刻就会撞上同一个需求：这些进程得交换数据、协调步调、互相通知。但它们各自被关在独立的地址空间里，连对方的一个指针都解引用不了。所有 IPC 机制，无论看起来多么花样百出，本质都在做同一件事——在内核监管下，于隔离的进程之间凿一条受控的通道。这一篇不深入任何单一机制，而是给出一张地图：通道一共有哪几大类、用哪些维度评判它们、以及如何在地图上快速定位一个需求。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>IPC 机制按「数据如何在进程间流动」可以归为三大族。消息式把数据打包成离散单元，经内核缓冲后投递，发收双方不共享内存；共享式让多个进程映射同一块物理内存，数据交换不再经过内核拷贝；网络式复用 socket 这套为跨主机设计的抽象来覆盖本机通信，并在其上叠加 RPC 等高层封装。三族之下，再按「同步还是异步」「传字节还是传结构」「本机还是可跨网」进一步细分。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[IPC 机制] --&gt; B[消息式&lt;br/&gt;内核中介+拷贝]&#10;    A --&gt; C[共享式&lt;br/&gt;同一物理内存]&#10;    A --&gt; D[网络式&lt;br/&gt;socket 抽象]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[管道 / FIFO]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[消息队列]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[信号]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[共享内存]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[内存映射文件]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[同步原语]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[Unix 域套接字]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[本地 RPC / D-Bus / binder]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[io_uring / eventfd]\">graph TD\n    A[IPC 机制] --&gt; B[消息式&lt;br/&gt;内核中介+拷贝]\n    A --&gt; C[共享式&lt;br/&gt;同一物理内存]\n    A --&gt; D[网络式&lt;br/&gt;socket 抽象]\n    B --&gt; B1[管道 / FIFO]\n    B --&gt; B2[消息队列]\n    B --&gt; B3[信号]\n    C --&gt; C1[共享内存]\n    C --&gt; C2[内存映射文件]\n    C --&gt; C3[同步原语]\n    D --&gt; D1[Unix 域套接字]\n    D --&gt; D2[本地 RPC / D-Bus / binder]\n    D --&gt; D3[io_uring / eventfd]</pre><p>这张图正是整个 hub 的目录结构。每个叶子节点都有一篇专属文档详述，本篇只负责把它们串成可比较的整体。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三大族的本质差异\">三大族的本质差异</h2><p>消息式的灵魂是「拷贝」。发送方调用 <code>write</code> 把数据交给内核，内核存进自己的缓冲区，接收方再调用 <code>read</code> 把它取走——一来一回至少两次跨边界拷贝。代价换来的是绝对的隔离与天然的流控：缓冲区满了发送方自动阻塞，无需程序员操心。<a href=\"../message-based/pipes-fifos\">管道</a>、<a href=\"../message-based/message-queues-ipc\">消息队列</a>与<a href=\"../message-based/signals\">信号</a>都属此族。</p>\n<p>共享式的灵魂是「不拷贝」。一旦两个进程把同一段物理页映射进各自地址空间，此后一方写、另一方立刻可读，内核完全退出数据路径。这让它成为延迟最低的 IPC，却也丢掉了内核免费提供的同步与保护——所以<a href=\"../shared-memory/shared-memory\">共享内存</a>永远要和<a href=\"../shared-memory/synchronization-primitives\">同步原语</a>配套使用。</p>\n<p>网络式的灵魂是「统一抽象」。<a href=\"../networked/unix-domain-sockets\">Unix 域套接字</a>让你用写网络服务的同一套代码处理本机通信，将来需要跨主机时几乎零改动。它还能传递文件描述符，这是其它机制做不到的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"评判维度\">评判维度</h2><p>要在三族之间做选择，需要一套统一的尺子。下表是贯穿全 hub 的评判维度，后续每篇文档都会回到这些维度上定位自己。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>谁占优</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>延迟</td>\n<td>一次数据交换的端到端耗时</td>\n<td>共享内存（无拷贝、无系统调用）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>吞吐</td>\n<td>单位时间能搬运的数据量</td>\n<td>共享内存 / io_uring</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据粒度</td>\n<td>通道的最小语义单元</td>\n<td>字节流（管道）vs 消息（队列）vs 纯通知（信号）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同步性</td>\n<td>阻塞投递还是异步通知</td>\n<td>信号 / eventfd 偏异步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>信任边界</td>\n<td>能否跨越权限/容器隔离安全使用</td>\n<td>域套接字（带凭证传递）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可移植性</td>\n<td>跨 OS 的可用程度</td>\n<td>管道 / 套接字最广</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生命周期</td>\n<td>通道随进程消亡还是内核持久</td>\n<td>共享内存内核持久，管道随进程</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>延迟与吞吐常被一起谈，但要分开看：信号延迟极低却几乎没有吞吐，管道吞吐尚可但每字节都有拷贝成本。这套维度的具体权衡留给<a href=\"ipc-tradeoffs\">IPC 选型权衡</a>展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一条数据的旅程\">一条数据的旅程</h2><p>为了感受三族的差异，设想同一份 4KB 数据从进程 A 到进程 B。在消息式里，它从 A 的用户缓冲被拷进内核缓冲，再被拷进 B 的用户缓冲，跨边界拷贝两次、系统调用两次。在共享式里，A 直接写进共享区，B 直接读，零拷贝、零系统调用（同步另算）。在网络式里，路径与消息式类似，但多了协议处理的开销（域套接字省掉了大部分）。</p>\n<p>形式化地看，消息式一次传输的成本约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{msg} = 2 C_{copy} + 2 C_{syscall}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">sy</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">sc</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，而共享式趋近于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{shm} \\approx C_{sync}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">hm</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">sy</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{sync}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">sy</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是同步原语的开销。当数据规模 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 增大时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{copy}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 成正比而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{sync}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">sy</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 基本恒定，这解释了为什么大数据量场景共享内存优势压倒性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么需要这么多机制\">为什么需要这么多机制</h2><p>一个自然的疑问是：既然共享内存最快，为什么不全用它？因为「最快」只在「数据量大、信任充分、愿意自己写同步」三个前提同时成立时才有意义。需要简单管道连接两个命令时，shell 的 <code>|</code> 一个字符就够了，没人会去搭共享内存加信号量。需要跨容器、跨权限边界安全通信时，又非域套接字的凭证机制不可。IPC 机制之多，正是因为「隔离的进程要通信」这个需求在不同维度上有着相互冲突的优先级，没有任何一种机制能同时拿满所有维度。</p>\n<p>理解这一点，比记住任何单个 API 都重要。后面每一章都是在这张地图的某个区域里做深度勘探。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用一段伪代码感受三族\">用一段伪代码感受三族</h2><p>把同一个「发 4KB 给对方」用三族各写一遍，差异一目了然。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// 消息式：管道——两次拷贝、收发各一次系统调用&#10;write(pipe_fd, buf, 4096);          // 用户 -&gt; 内核&#10;read(pipe_fd, peer_buf, 4096);      // 内核 -&gt; 用户&#10;&#10;// 共享式：写共享区即完成，无系统调用&#10;memcpy(shm_ptr, buf, 4096);         // 直接写物理共享页&#10;sem_post(&amp;shm-&gt;ready);              // 仅同步时才陷入内核&#10;&#10;// 网络式：域套接字，接口同网络但走本机&#10;send(uds_fd, buf, 4096, 0);&#10;recv(uds_fd, peer_buf, 4096, 0);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 消息式：管道——两次拷贝、收发各一次系统调用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">write</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(pipe_fd, buf, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4096</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          // 用户 -> 内核</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">read</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(pipe_fd, peer_buf, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4096</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // 内核 -> 用户</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 共享式：写共享区即完成，无系统调用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">memcpy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(shm_ptr, buf, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4096</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">         // 直接写物理共享页</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sem_post</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">shm</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ready</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">              // 仅同步时才陷入内核</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 网络式：域套接字，接口同网络但走本机</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">send</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(uds_fd, buf, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4096</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">recv</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(uds_fd, peer_buf, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4096</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意共享式那一行 <code>memcpy</code> 根本没碰内核——数据路径上只有一条普通访存指令；而另两族每次收发都要陷入内核。这三行代码就是本 hub 全部性能差异的缩影。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>IPC 的根本任务：在隔离的地址空间之间凿出内核监管的受控通道，原因详见<a href=\"process-isolation\">进程隔离与地址空间</a>。</li>\n<li>三大族按数据流动方式划分：消息式（拷贝+内核中介）、共享式（同一物理内存、零拷贝）、网络式（socket 统一抽象）。</li>\n<li>七个评判维度——延迟、吞吐、粒度、同步性、信任边界、可移植性、生命周期——构成全 hub 的通用语言。</li>\n<li>没有银弹：机制之多源于需求在各维度上的优先级冲突，选型框架见<a href=\"ipc-tradeoffs\">IPC 选型权衡</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"IPC 概览与分类","id":"ipc-概览与分类"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"三大族的本质差异","id":"三大族的本质差异"},{"level":2,"text":"评判维度","id":"评判维度"},{"level":2,"text":"一条数据的旅程","id":"一条数据的旅程"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么需要这么多机制","id":"为什么需要这么多机制"},{"level":2,"text":"用一段伪代码感受三族","id":"用一段伪代码感受三族"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"进程隔离与地址空间","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/inter-process-communication/foundations/process-isolation"}}